From: MOM Harness <mom-harness@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] lua: add explicit unsafe sandbox authority

Derived from openmw_build_scripts patch 13858be6fd6ef1075b5dae9920fad0ff93a30839.
Rebased as one self-contained patch against OpenMW
ea120a9f72d3d3064fc09c38b7ae3f50a43e4a6e.

Unsafe standard libraries must not appear in ordinary sandboxes merely because
the runtime provides them. Add a default-off setting and publish selected
libraries only through select("sandbox.bypass"). This is harness-only debugging
and benchmarking authority, not a production sandbox API.

